-near-arunachal-satellite-data/articleshow/136111992.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136111992.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Recent satellite images reveal notable advancement on China's 60 GW Medog hydropower project, raising concerns for downstream India. In response, India's Siang Upper Multipurpose Project is being proposed to manage water flow. A report from EarthSense Labs underscores significant site preparations and infrastructural work, prompting local communities in India to express worries about environmental ramifications and potential displacement.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/chinas-mega-dam-takes-shape-near-arunachal-satellite-data/articleshow/136111992.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/chinas-mega-dam-takes-shape-near-arunachal-satellite-data/articleshow/136111992.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-24T04:36:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prabin Kalita</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136117449,imgsize-364014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Swiss PIO in SC: Can govt protect my special child?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/swiss-pio-in-sc-can-govt-protect-my-special-child/articleshow/136116125.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136116125.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Court Seeks Centre Response To Father's Plea]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/swiss-pio-in-sc-can-govt-protect-my-special-child/articleshow/136116125.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/swiss-pio-in-sc-can-govt-protect-my-special-child/articleshow/136116125.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-24T04:35:5